{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/951142-hunter-2e-suggestion-give-a-keyword-to-hunter-supporters","id":951142,"title":"Hunter 2E suggestion: Give a keyword to Hunter supporters","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-15T09:04:56-07:00","id":951142,"title":"Hunter 2E suggestion: Give a keyword to Hunter supporters","content":"In the World of Darkness nearly every mortal has at least some personal experience with the supernatural. However immense social and perhaps psychological pressure makes them keep their mouth shut and their wilful disbelief strong. Depending on your personal WoD the Lie from Mage may be involved.<br /> <br /> In the Hunter setting there's plenty of people who've broken free of that social pressure but are not actually monster hunters: The back office staff in a Conspiracy. The people who watch and comment on Network Zero youtube videos from the safety of their bedrooms. The people represented by The Union's Friends and Neighbours Endowment? <br /> <br /> I propose that a capital letter keyword is created for such people so they can be easily refereed to.<br /> <br /> <br /> Tagging in <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1870-mlvalentine\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar1870_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"1870\" data-vbnamecard=\"1870\">mlvalentine</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Ful